<title>SPAIN: Endesa ups stake in Cepsa to 7.92 pc.</title>
<headline>Endesa ups stake in Cepsa to 7.92 pc.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1997-01-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Spanish electricity group Endesa has lifted its stake in oil firm Cepsa by 2.3 percentage points to 7.92 percent, sources at Banco Central Hispano (BCH) said on Friday.</p>
<p>BCH, which carried out the transaction, said Endesa bought the stake from The SMM Company at a price of 3,831 pesetas per share for a total value of 7.86 billion pesetas.</p>
<p>-- Madrid newsroom +341 585 2160</p>
</text>
